sequenceDiagram
    participant Tab as React Tab
    participant Poll as usePolling (2s)
    participant Guard as readinessGuard
    participant Svc as Backend Service

    Tab->>Poll: Mount (visible)
    Poll->>Guard: GET /api/* (timeout 10s)
    alt Chưa sẵn sàng
        Guard-->>Tab: 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE
    else Đã sẵn sàng
        Guard->>Svc: Forward request
        Svc-->>Tab: 200 OK (JSON)
    end
